  "definition_ja": "式や関数の文字に与えられた数を代入して、その値を計算する。極限や定積分の値を計算するときにも使う。",
  "definition_en": "To work out the numerical value of an expression or function by substituting given numbers for its variables; also used for computing a limit or a definite integral.",
  "latex": null,
  "spoken_en": null,
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "To evaluate this at x = 2, just plug in 2 everywhere you see an x.",
      "ja": "x = 2 のときの値を求めるには、x のところ全部に 2 を代入すればいい。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Evaluate 3x² − 5x + 1 when x = −2.",
